WEBVTT

00:05:57.478 --> 00:06:00.398
This, first and foremost,
necessitates resettling refugees

00:06:00.439 --> 00:06:02.983
who are currently waiting
in camps around the world,

00:06:02.983 --> 00:06:05.653
to reach a place that they can call home.

00:06:05.694 --> 00:06:08.989
It also calls upon the international
community to increase quotas

00:06:09.031 --> 00:06:10.199
for Afghan allies

00:06:10.199 --> 00:06:13.035
to accept more at-risk Afghans
for permanent resettlement

00:06:13.035 --> 00:06:16.539
and to expand programs
like humanitarian parole,

00:06:16.539 --> 00:06:18.999
to generate more pathways
for those in need.

00:06:19.959 --> 00:06:21.293
Third ...

00:06:21.335 --> 00:06:23.712
As we find pathways forward
for these individuals,

00:06:23.712 --> 00:06:27.633
we must not separate families,
we must preserve them.

00:06:28.008 --> 00:06:32.096
(Applause)